            "review_title": "Review at Yakiniku Kokoro",
            "review_text": "mote-jp\nBolivia17 contributions\n0\n(Delivery) I can't believe that meat for yakiniku at home is delivered already cooked...\nDec 2023 • Family\nI used a delivery service to order some raw meat from the menu to have at home, including kalbi, skirt steak, and innards.\nI was looking forward to the meat, which was reasonably priced, but what arrived was grilled meat wrapped in aluminum foil! The meat had become dry from time to time!\nI never expected to receive grilled meat!\n\nI had had deliveries from various Japanese yakiniku restaurants in Hanoi before, but I had never received grilled meat, so it was unexpected.\nI had let my guard down because of the Japanese sign, but I was reminded that I am in a foreign country where my common sense does not apply.\nBy the way, I was so surprised that I called the restaurant, but they hung up the phone immediately.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten February 19, 2024",
